{% set label = label is defined ? label : 'Churning'|trans %}{% set variant = variant is defined ? variant : 'Drive' %}{% set delays = variant == 'Orbit' ? [0,110,220,770,null,330,660,550,440] : [90,180,270,0,90,180,90,180,270] %}{% set duration = variant == 'Orbit' ? 950 : 650 %}<div data-component="loading-state" data-variant="{{ variant }}" data-default-label="{{ 'Churning'|trans }}" data-class-name="{{ className|default('') }}" data-elapsed-label="{{ 'Elapsed time %elapsed%'|trans }}" class="loading-state {{ className|default('') }}"><span aria-hidden="true" class="loading-state__grid">{% for delay in delays %}<span class="loading-state__pixel" style="opacity:{{ delay is same as(null) ? 0.07 : 0.15 }};animation:{{ delay is same as(null) ? 'none' : 'core-loading-pixel ' ~ duration ~ 'ms ease-in-out ' ~ delay ~ 'ms infinite' }}"></span>{% endfor %}</span><span data-label class="loading-state__label" style="background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #a3a3a3 35%, currentColor 50%, #a3a3a3 65%);background-size:200% 100%;animation:core-loading-shimmer 1.4s linear infinite">{{ label }}</span><span role="timer" aria-label="{{ 'Elapsed time %elapsed%'|trans({'%elapsed%':'0.0s'}) }}" class="loading-state__timer">0.0s</span></div>
